WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.030
He's still alive.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.450
You wanna talk about it?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.200
Every night I have the same nightmare.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:27.950
That day…

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.570
that was hell.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.690
I remember…

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.410
people screaming.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.400
What's going on?

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.150
They get bitten and then they turn.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.740
And you watch it spread...

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:51.320
and spread.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.030
It's terrifying.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.330
Leon?

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.450
It's gotta be another outbreak.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.400
I gotta go.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.780
Don't do anything stupid.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.820
Raccoon City was the beginning.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.820
We can't let what happen stay buried.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.620
If we went public with this…

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.820
we could expose a conspiracy.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.910
I can't get anyone to go on record
about the outbreak.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.370
I'm sorry, I don't know what to tell you.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:33.120
We need to show the world
that we are a strong nation.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.370
Capable of protecting the interests
of the free world.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.120
We must be the source of hope
to those who seek freedom.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.950
We cannot allow anyone
to interfere with peace and prosperity.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.660
What are you here for?

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:50.990
That's classified.

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:55.450
Do you know where the root
of terror comes from?

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.060
It starts with fear.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:06.990
I will show you fear.

